  "releaseNotes": "## What's New\n\t\tThe SDK has been extended to include several more Configuration Items: Access Control System, Access Control Group, Access Control Unit, LPR MatchList, GisMap Location, Compressor, Tool Option, Translation, System Address, Child Site, Failover Group, Failover Recorder, Owner and Server. Additionally the RawSource class has been added for getting live and recorded streams from the VMS.",
